  "body": "Fix https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=28113\n\nThe text of the HTML fragment serialisation algorithm [#serialising-html-fragments](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/syntax.html#serialising-html-fragments) says that the algorithm may throw an exception, but it doesn't indicate which exceptions or the circumstances in which they should be thrown.\nIt is misleading as it never throws an exception.\n",
